// P10b armor endowments (17 hardmode sets + 5 pre-HM sets handed over from P10a); the four Ancient Hallowed combos share one line
GsForbiddenArmor.EndowLine: Sandbound Shades: strikes build sand-soul; at 6 stacks a sand shade rises (up to 2) to haunt your side and spit whirling sand bolts
GsSpookyWoodArmor.EndowLine: Hallow's Patrol: strikes build soulfire; at 6 stacks a jack-o'-lantern rises (up to 2) to patrol around you and spit triple ghostflame at the nearest foe
GsChlorophyteArmor.EndowLine: Symbiotic Vine: strikes build spores; at 8 stacks the next strike plants a parasite vine, and every strike on the host lashes a vine-blade at a second foe; the vine bursts into a spore cloud when it withers
GsPumpkinArmor.EndowLine: Gourd Harvest: strikes build vines; at 6 stacks the next strike plants a blast gourd that ripens in 3s (strike the victim again to force it), bursting into three spinning slices
GsGladiatorArmor.EndowLine: Triumph Volley: strikes build acclaim; at 6 stacks the next strike hurls three bronze javelins over your shoulder in arcing volleys at the foe
